  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leveraging the peace process for stronger protection of human rights in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">to allow UN Human Rights to further strengthen its  interventions around  support to accountability for violations through enhanced outreach and monitoring in northern Ethiopia and surrounding hotspot regions, broadening, and deepening the scope of its early warning networks for the prevention of violations (early warning for early action), political strategic analyses as a tool for advocacy, and to reinforce technical support and capacity building on human rights, especially on accountability and transitional justice.</narrative>
  </description>
